Error [E0130]: `Int` and `BigInt` can't be mixed — got ``BigInt`` and `Int (a whole number)`
  --> tests/ui/bigint_int_mix.jet:4:11
    |
  4 |     print(x + y)
    |           ^^^^^
 Why: precise numeric types never mix with fixed-width integers or floats without an explicit constructor
 Fix: fixed-width `Int` never promotes to `BigInt`; construct a `BigInt` explicitly with `BigInt(…)` or `BigInt("…")`
